  "contract": "#3137, #3472, #3687. Three Spell.dbc passives that are plain family-35 spell modifiers with no script: Venomcult Scrolls 707574 (effect 0 aura 108 op 0 +49+1 = +50% on mask [0x200] = seek heal 803529; effect 1 aura 107 op 11 -2001+1 = -2000 ms on mask [0x1] = Green Salve 800902, whose CategoryRecoveryTime is 10000); Cunning 805093 (effect 0 aura 107 op 7 = +19+1 = 20 crit chance points and effect 1 aura 108 op 15 = +9+1 = +10% crit damage, both on mask [0,0,0x2000000] = Chitin Rush 803570, 803641-803644, 803728); Caustic 807610 (aura 107 op 11 -60001+1 = -60000 ms on mask [0x40000000] = Noxious Empowerment 804964, RecoveryTime 180000). The native consumers are Player::ApplySpellMod through Player::AddSpellCooldown (Player.cpp:11452/11456), Unit::SpellHealingBonusDone (Unit.cpp:10217) and Unit::SpellDoneCritChance. Each modifier is read with spell_modifier from a same-run baseline; the cooldowns are additionally measured on a real cast before and after learning the passive. Noxious Empowerment needs Spider Form 800841 (Spell.dbc CasterAuraSpell). Generic core machinery: a regression guard for behaviour that already works.",
